#### 4d (Kubernetes manifest). The three probes in a real Deployment

```yaml
# k8s/deployment.yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: transfer-service
spec:
  replicas: 3
  template:
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: transfer
          image: nbi/transfer-service:1.0.0
          ports: [{ containerPort: 8080 }]
          # STARTUP: tolerate up to 30*5 = 150s of boot before liveness/readiness kick in
          startupProbe:
            httpGet: { path: /actuator/health/liveness, port: 8080 }
            failureThreshold: 30
            periodSeconds: 5
          # LIVENESS: trivial "am I alive" — failure restarts the container
          livenessProbe:
            httpGet: { path: /actuator/health/liveness, port: 8080 }
            periodSeconds: 10
            failureThreshold: 3
          # READINESS: depends on DB/pool — failure removes Pod from Service
          readinessProbe:
            httpGet: { path: /actuator/health/readiness, port: 8080 }
            periodSeconds: 5
            failureThreshold: 2
